note={D. Findings.},
note={D1. In terms of the long-term operation and thermal recovery performance for U-type BHE, the results show that the thermal recovery rate of deep rock and soil is over 91.2{\%} after an eight-month thermal recovery period [18].},
note={D2. Compared with this, variable-flow operation reduces the power consumption of the heat pump unit from 171,090 kW{\textperiodcentered}h to 168,043 kW{\textperiodcentered}h, and the circulating pump power consumption from 117,332 kW{\textperiodcentered}h to 56,548 kW{\textperiodcentered}h, resulting in a total reduction in power consumption of 22.1{\%}.},
note={D3. Circulating pump power consumption from 117,332 kW{\textperiodcentered}h to 56,548 kW{\textperiodcentered}h, resulting in a total reduction inpower powerconsumption consumptionfrom of 22.1{\%}.},
