note={E9. Objectives.},
note={E10. The objective of the study is to propose a variable-flow operation model for medium-depth U-type ground source heat pump systems, which can optimize the system's performance and reduce energy consumption. The study aims to evaluate the system's performance based on factors such as thermal conductivity of the backfill material, drilling structure, and flow rate of the circulating fluid..},
