note={D2. The current program, H2020, establishes the following targets in this eld to be attained by year 2020: greenhouse gas emissions reductions of 20{\%} compared to 1990 levels, a share of renewable energy consumption of 20{\%} and improvements in energy eciency of 20{\%}.},
