note={D9. n = 1 $\alpha$ [0,0.5 ]. As it can be observed in Fig. 2.21, the heat pump remains in state n = 1 for partial load ratios lower than or equal to 50{\%} ($\alpha$ {\&}lt;= 0.5).},
note={D10. DPF1 DPF2 DPF3 DPF4. As it can be observed in Fig. 2.37, DP F1 and DP F2 show lower values in heating mode than in cooling mode (around 15{\%} lower), due to the higher temperature lift that the compressor has to overcome during winter.},
